## KHỐI XÂY · 08:30–10:30

```dockerfile
FROM node:22-alpine AS deps
WORKDIR /app
COPY package*.json ./
RUN npm ci

FROM node:22-alpine AS build
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=deps /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY . .
RUN npm run build

FROM node:22-alpine AS runner
WORKDIR /app
ENV NODE_ENV=production
COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist
COPY --from=build /app/node_modules ./node_modules
COPY package*.json ./
USER node
EXPOSE 3000
CMD ["node", "dist/index.js"]
```

`.dockerignore`: `node_modules`, `.env`, `test`.

```bash
docker build -t macrozone-api .
docker run --rm -p 3000:3000 --env-file .env.docker macrozone-api
```

